{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QwP9wQV5x1urQwhPHV1A2X","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_2/projects/persuasion_turn_jailbreak_detect/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-17\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **phase_b_full** (success): Persuasion-grounded DeBERTa embeddings (multi-task fine-tuned on 8-class persuasion + intent) enable significantly earlier detection of Crescendo jailbreak attacks compared to vanilla DeBERTa embeddings, especially at low K (2-3 turns) ← 基于 pilot_phase_b\\\\n- **pilot_phase_b** (success): Persuasion-aware DeBERTa embeddings (multi-task fine-tuned) fed to Bi-GRU will outperform vanilla DeBERTa embeddings at early detection (K=2,3,5 turns) of Crescendo-style jailbreak attacks\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 2 / 负向 0 / 失败 0 / 共 2\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nwestd-33183: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 707, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01QTKqei1UnyDwus8raWiTB6","session_id":"28a3eef2-233e-4eb5-bfe4-3efac3de241f","uuid":"71920617-466d-47bd-86cd-79e9d8cb2b81","timestamp":"2026-05-17T17:29:20.427Z"}
